{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "22", "m": "08", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "06", "M": "18", "S": "57"}}, "news": [{"title": "NCLT removes IRP from stalled Noida project for hiding charges against him", "para": "The NCLT has officially dismissed Narender Kumar Sharma from his role as IRP for the Festival City housing project due to non-disclosure of disciplinary actions and the absence of proper authorization. Sudhir Kumar Agarwal has been appointed as his replacement. It's crucial for Sharma to transfer all project documentation to Agarwal, and any costs incurred during Sharma's administration are excluded from the resolution expenses.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/nclt-removes-irp-from-stalled-noida-project-for-hiding-charges-against-him/133417058?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-43494/133417058.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "SBI acquires commercial property in Pune\u2019s Kharadi for \u20b9414 crore", "para": "The State Bank of India has finalised the acquisition of a commercial property in Pune for Rs 414 crore. This deal covers both land leasehold rights and a commercial structure situated in Kharadi, a bustling business district.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/commercial/sbi-acquires-commercial-property-in-punes-kharadi-for-414-crore/133416903?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-107238/133416903.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "commercial"}, {"title": "Ban on construction activities in Delhi from December 10 to January 20 to curb air pollution", "para": "Construction activities will be completely banned in Delhi from December 10 to January 20. This measure aims to curb air pollution during the upcoming winter season. Citizens are urged to report any violations of this directive. Sites above 500 square meters will be monitored using AI cameras and a special portal. Notices, warnings, and fines will be issued for non-compliance with the ban.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/ban-on-construction-activities-in-delhi-from-december-10-to-january-20-to-curb-air-pollution/133416886?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-31988/133416886.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}]}